<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36249" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pĭco</span></b> , āvi, ātum,
		1, v. a.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to bedaub with pitch</i>, <i>to pitch</i>, <i>to tar.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dolia picata, lacus, vinarius picatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 25 sq.</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dolia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Claud. 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">parietes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					36, 22, 48, § 166</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">11, 7, 6,
				§ 16</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>to season with
				pitch</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 23</span></i>
			.— Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pĭcātus</span></b> , a, um,
				P. a., <i>pitchy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum picatum,</span>”
				<i>wine that has naturally a pitchy taste</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					23, 1, 24, § 47</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">14, 2, 4,
				§ 26</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 13, 107</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
